[00:12.66]1. What love Jehovah showed,
[00:12.66]What goodness from him flowed,
[00:12.66]When for all mankind he offered his Firstborn.
[00:20.68]Christ took on human form—
[00:20.68]The Son of man was born—
[00:20.72]By his example, God’s name he adorned.
[00:20.72]2. Jehovah’s Word, he said,
[00:21.44]Sustained his life like bread.
[00:21.76]It gave him wisdom and knowledge and insight.
[00:47.34]His Father’s willing slave,
[00:51.76]A model Jesus gave;
[00:51.76]To please his Father would bring him delight.
[03:20.74]3. Like Jesus, may our days
[03:25.10]Provide Jehovah praise,
[03:28.40]And may his footsteps become our own roadway.
[03:37.08]Let Jesus’ model be
[03:40.60]Our path eternally,
[03:44.78]And then God’s favor we’ll know day by day.
